WEBVTT

00:07.166 --> 00:08.541
Get over here, hey!

00:09.166 --> 00:11.000
-Hey.
-Take that!

00:17.083 --> 00:17.916
Hey.

00:19.458 --> 00:21.416
Do you enjoy picking on the weak?

00:22.583 --> 00:24.708
Huh? Who the hell are you?

00:24.791 --> 00:26.416
You got a problem? Huh?

00:36.458 --> 00:37.666
Stop following me.

00:38.166 --> 00:41.500
Shinjo,
I heard you're a Taekwondo champion.

00:44.708 --> 00:45.833
Teach me.

00:45.916 --> 00:47.500
Shut up. I already quit.

00:49.458 --> 00:50.500
Shinjo!

00:50.583 --> 00:53.416
I want to be stronger.

01:20.500 --> 01:21.333
Shit.

01:22.291 --> 01:24.458
He's really gonna kill Shimura.

01:34.125 --> 01:35.750
I don't like the police.

01:36.750 --> 01:38.291
No one's getting in my way.

01:41.750 --> 01:43.125
Don't you dare

01:44.208 --> 01:45.541
lay a finger on Kanegon.

01:48.875 --> 01:49.875
Shimura!

01:50.875 --> 01:53.041
Enough! Make him stop!

01:56.916 --> 01:58.083
Is he important to you?

02:00.916 --> 02:02.291
If he is…

02:04.958 --> 02:06.625
you need to protect him.

02:20.666 --> 02:22.500
He can't use his calf kick now.

02:28.625 --> 02:31.250
Shimura, you've done enough.

02:31.333 --> 02:33.666
If you keep going, you'll die!

02:34.250 --> 02:35.500
Don't interfere.

02:37.791 --> 02:39.125
Shinjo…

02:40.125 --> 02:41.208
Are you satisfied?

02:42.666 --> 02:46.166
Forcing my friend
to watch me get my ass handed to me.

02:49.250 --> 02:50.375
You

02:51.333 --> 02:53.500
aren't a psychopath.

02:55.833 --> 02:56.916
Let's be real.

02:58.333 --> 03:00.000
You're just jealous

03:01.125 --> 03:02.291
of us.

03:03.125 --> 03:05.208
What the hell are you saying?

03:07.583 --> 03:09.000
Kanegon…

03:10.875 --> 03:13.208
is my first best friend.

03:16.041 --> 03:19.000
I will never forgive you…

03:21.708 --> 03:24.416
for hurting my friend.

03:28.416 --> 03:29.916
Shut up! Stop talking!

03:34.083 --> 03:35.458
Shimura!

03:36.375 --> 03:38.333
I'm ending the stream, Kanegon.

03:40.875 --> 03:41.875
This is it.

03:44.291 --> 03:46.250
As promised, I'm taking your channel.

03:54.875 --> 03:56.125
Stop it.

03:56.208 --> 03:57.375
What?

03:57.458 --> 03:58.625
I've already stopped.

03:59.375 --> 04:01.375
Please, stop.

04:02.041 --> 04:02.875
I have.

04:02.958 --> 04:05.000
I said no more, damn it!

04:05.083 --> 04:06.458
Shimura!

04:15.541 --> 04:16.375
HE STOOD UP!

04:16.458 --> 04:17.666
GET HIM, SHIMURA!

04:19.875 --> 04:21.708
How a novice…

04:24.041 --> 04:25.750
can beat a taekwondo…

04:26.333 --> 04:29.458
Have you lost your mind?

04:31.375 --> 04:32.458
…fighter.

04:34.208 --> 04:38.208
If you eat a kick in there,
you're really going to die.

04:39.291 --> 04:40.458
Rule one.

04:43.791 --> 04:44.666
All right.

04:48.250 --> 04:49.166
I'll kill you.

04:55.416 --> 04:56.708
Die!

05:00.333 --> 05:05.833
How a novice can beat
a taekwondo fighter, rule one.

05:08.333 --> 05:12.291
Dominate the space
to shut down their kicks!

05:13.291 --> 05:15.208
Everything is for this technique.

05:18.833 --> 05:22.375
Grab the back of their collar
like you're holding a bat,

05:22.458 --> 05:25.000
and lift them onto your shoulder!

05:48.083 --> 05:48.916
Get him.

05:51.750 --> 05:52.583
WHOAAAAAA!!

05:52.666 --> 05:54.041
DON'T LOOSEN YOUR GRIP!

05:54.708 --> 05:55.625
Get him, Shimura.

06:30.958 --> 06:32.875
Knock out! Shimura won.

06:35.958 --> 06:37.083
You did it!

06:37.166 --> 06:38.708
Shimura, you won!

06:46.583 --> 06:48.291
He's already out! Make him stop!

06:53.166 --> 06:54.041
It's over!

06:54.125 --> 06:55.541
-Let go!
-Shimura!

06:56.541 --> 06:59.625
Shimura, if you don't let go, he'll die!

06:59.708 --> 07:00.875
Shimura!

07:03.458 --> 07:04.291
Hey.

07:06.250 --> 07:07.750
Well done!

07:08.875 --> 07:10.291
You're really something!

07:23.333 --> 07:25.541
TAEKWONDO TOURNAMENT
WINNER REO SHINJO

07:32.000 --> 07:34.250
CHAMPION
TAEKWONDO TOURNAMENT

07:34.333 --> 07:35.458
Don't touch that.

07:35.541 --> 07:36.375
Sorry.

07:38.000 --> 07:40.208
Shinjo, you really are amazing.

07:41.583 --> 07:43.458
I suck at everything I do…

07:45.000 --> 07:47.916
Do you think I can be
a champion like you someday?

07:51.000 --> 07:52.125
-Last one!
-Yes!

07:55.791 --> 07:56.708
Thank you.

08:01.416 --> 08:02.250
Huh?

08:03.541 --> 08:04.833
You can have it.

08:04.916 --> 08:06.791
But Shinjo, this is your--

08:06.875 --> 08:07.750
Zip it.

08:08.250 --> 08:10.416
Wear it and be stronger.

08:11.375 --> 08:12.208
Are you sure?

08:13.875 --> 08:14.916
Thanks.

08:16.583 --> 08:19.125
I'll cherish it for the rest of my life.

08:25.041 --> 08:27.166
Takuma's at the former Ikebe factory site.

08:43.375 --> 08:44.208
Takuma!

08:45.791 --> 08:46.625
Hey!

08:47.375 --> 08:48.791
Hang in there!

08:53.500 --> 08:54.375
I'm sorry…

08:55.833 --> 08:57.125
I couldn't

08:57.833 --> 08:59.583
be strong…

09:06.208 --> 09:07.041
Hey.

09:08.750 --> 09:09.583
Wake up.

09:12.625 --> 09:14.375
I said wake up!

09:14.458 --> 09:15.333
Takuma!

09:49.958 --> 09:52.250
Let's go. He'll kill us if he wakes up.

09:52.333 --> 09:54.208
We can't leave him here passed out.

10:04.375 --> 10:06.125
What the hell were you doing?

10:06.208 --> 10:09.166
It's not what you think.
He went a little overboard.

10:09.666 --> 10:11.416
I was so desperate that I…

10:20.250 --> 10:22.291
Don't ever show your face again.

10:29.125 --> 10:30.500
Damn, he's scary.

10:31.000 --> 10:33.208
He really was a crazy bastard.

10:34.291 --> 10:35.208
He was

10:35.833 --> 10:37.000
crying.

10:37.083 --> 10:38.250
What?

10:38.333 --> 10:40.833
What are you talking about?
There's no way.

10:42.041 --> 10:43.875
Is your foot okay?

10:43.958 --> 10:45.708
Uh, I think so.

10:45.791 --> 10:46.750
Yeah?

11:00.291 --> 11:03.541
WAY MORE INTENSE THAN BAD FELLOWS!

11:03.625 --> 11:06.250
DON'T COMPARE THIS TO THAT STAGED SHOW

11:06.333 --> 11:09.750
VIRAL HIT IS THE REAL DEAL

11:09.833 --> 11:11.833
BAD FELLOWS IS WASHED-UP

11:11.916 --> 11:12.916
I apologize.

11:13.000 --> 11:16.333
I should've finished them off back then.

11:20.333 --> 11:21.916
It's fine.

11:23.500 --> 11:24.333
In fact,

11:26.458 --> 11:28.250
this is getting interesting.

11:41.375 --> 11:43.458
He won. He did great.

11:44.416 --> 11:46.208
What a relief…

11:48.583 --> 11:49.875
Is he hurt?

11:50.666 --> 11:52.000
I wonder if he's okay.

11:55.625 --> 11:58.208
He took a beating, but he should be fine.

12:03.958 --> 12:06.666
Why do you worry so much about that man?

12:06.750 --> 12:07.750
IS HE HURT?

12:07.833 --> 12:08.958
HE TOOK A BEATING

12:10.541 --> 12:13.083
Those videos exist
because you befriended him.

12:13.166 --> 12:14.083
HOT GIRLFRIEND!

12:14.166 --> 12:15.625
Stay away from him.

12:15.708 --> 12:18.416
Why? Why can't I see him?

12:18.500 --> 12:22.791
Because he has nothing
that will benefit your future.

12:23.333 --> 12:24.916
-That's not true.
-Kaho!

12:25.916 --> 12:29.416
Don't tell me
you plan on seeing that man again.

12:31.416 --> 12:32.416
I won't see him

12:33.416 --> 12:34.500
ever again.

12:36.708 --> 12:39.041
BARBER YASHIO

12:45.083 --> 12:46.375
1,012,054 SUBSCRIBERS

12:46.458 --> 12:48.250
We hit a million subscribers!

12:48.333 --> 12:49.541
That's major!

12:49.625 --> 12:51.333
Hell yeah!

12:53.208 --> 12:54.666
Aki! What about donations?

12:55.583 --> 12:58.875
This time, we got

12:59.416 --> 13:01.000
1.78 million!

13:01.583 --> 13:03.583
Hold on. That means we raked in…

13:04.083 --> 13:05.875
1.068 million yen!

13:06.500 --> 13:08.875
We made over a million in one stream!

13:08.958 --> 13:11.833
Our total revenue to date is 2.3 million!

13:11.916 --> 13:13.583
Good on you.

13:14.625 --> 13:15.916
AMOUNT DUE: 3.14M YEN

13:16.000 --> 13:18.291
You think it'll be the same next time?

13:18.375 --> 13:20.166
That'll be easy-peasy.

13:20.250 --> 13:22.750
We're one of the popular streamers now.

13:23.250 --> 13:25.625
Our time has finally come.

13:26.125 --> 13:27.041
You excited?

13:27.125 --> 13:28.583
About what?

13:28.666 --> 13:30.833
About school tomorrow.

13:35.416 --> 13:37.083
Look! It's Shimura!

13:49.000 --> 13:50.958
Well? How does it feel?

13:51.458 --> 13:52.291
Yeah…

13:52.791 --> 13:54.041
Not bad.

13:54.875 --> 13:55.750
Pay attention.

13:56.333 --> 13:59.708
This is what
the view from the top looks like.

14:13.541 --> 14:15.083
It feels good

14:15.166 --> 14:17.458
to enjoy the view from the top.

14:17.958 --> 14:19.291
What're you saying?

14:20.125 --> 14:21.791
Have you lost your mind?

14:21.875 --> 14:24.791
I followed your account.
Can you follow me back?

14:24.875 --> 14:26.625
Me too. Will you?

14:27.833 --> 14:31.458
You repulse me.
Turning to the internet for friends now?

14:34.416 --> 14:35.750
I was joking.

14:40.791 --> 14:43.375
-Hi, Aki.
-I watch your channel every day.

14:56.666 --> 14:57.916
We're gonna crash!

15:21.000 --> 15:22.083
29,800 YEN

15:23.041 --> 15:24.666
You're not gonna buy them?

15:24.750 --> 15:26.166
Well, they're a bit…

15:26.666 --> 15:28.500
You need a pair of new shoes.

15:28.583 --> 15:30.958
You deserve to treat yourself this much.

15:31.041 --> 15:31.958
Right, Aki?

15:32.458 --> 15:34.750
It's up to him to decide.

15:34.833 --> 15:36.583
Well, yeah, but…

15:37.916 --> 15:40.208
You're gonna confess to Asamiya, right?

15:43.250 --> 15:44.083
Yeah.

15:44.166 --> 15:48.083
It'd be rude to confess to her
in those ratty old shoes.

15:48.166 --> 15:49.000
Okay?

16:06.000 --> 16:07.750
What do we have here?

16:08.541 --> 16:10.041
It's a little gift.

16:10.125 --> 16:12.208
Really? For me?

16:16.625 --> 16:17.583
Kota…

16:17.666 --> 16:20.666
Don't worry about it.
I got a special bonus at work.

16:20.750 --> 16:22.291
That's not what I mean.

16:22.375 --> 16:24.583
Are you involved in anything illegal?

16:24.666 --> 16:25.500
Huh?

16:26.125 --> 16:27.250
Like shady jobs?

16:27.333 --> 16:30.250
Of course not. Why would you think that?

16:30.333 --> 16:32.166
Thank goodness.

16:33.208 --> 16:34.916
Thank you.

16:36.041 --> 16:37.000
I'll cherish it.

16:37.708 --> 16:38.625
Yeah.

16:38.708 --> 16:40.875
It's so pretty.

16:47.583 --> 16:49.041
Thank you for the meal.

16:51.250 --> 16:53.208
You've barely touched your food.

16:53.291 --> 16:54.708
I have no appetite.

16:54.791 --> 16:55.875
Do you feel sick?

16:55.958 --> 16:57.041
No.

16:57.125 --> 16:58.250
Then what is it?

16:58.750 --> 17:01.541
Is it that maybe
you have a crush on someone?

17:02.541 --> 17:05.125
Is it the blonde dude
or the black-haired guy?

17:05.208 --> 17:06.208
Which one?

17:06.291 --> 17:07.958
That's called harassment.

17:22.041 --> 17:23.708
I'll be

17:23.791 --> 17:27.416
coming back to work tomorrow.

17:28.166 --> 17:33.500
Can we walk home together after work?

18:01.541 --> 18:03.291
So what's this simple job?

18:07.916 --> 18:09.041
Well…

18:10.083 --> 18:10.916
Here.

18:11.916 --> 18:13.125
Pick one from here.

18:13.208 --> 18:14.791
CLIENT LIST

18:15.291 --> 18:16.500
BUSINESS OWNER

18:16.583 --> 18:17.708
CHIEF DIRECTOR

18:21.000 --> 18:22.708
What… is this?

18:25.791 --> 18:28.916
These are our important sponsors.

18:44.166 --> 18:45.125
Yes?

18:45.208 --> 18:46.333
This is Watanabe.

18:52.666 --> 18:54.291
Sorry to keep you waiting.

18:54.375 --> 18:56.333
I was held up at work.

19:01.416 --> 19:02.875
Are you nervous?

19:03.916 --> 19:04.750
Yes.

19:05.875 --> 19:07.000
That's fine.

19:07.500 --> 19:09.500
Everyone is nervous at first.

19:10.500 --> 19:11.583
That's what I like.

19:13.458 --> 19:15.166
Here, have a drink.

19:29.833 --> 19:30.708
Tea?

19:31.375 --> 19:33.208
I wouldn't do that.

19:33.291 --> 19:35.625
Make a minor drink alcohol.

19:40.291 --> 19:44.291
I have a daughter who's your age.

19:44.916 --> 19:49.750
She's wasting her time
on foolish things like romance.

19:50.333 --> 19:55.083
All she has to do is do what I tell her.

20:01.625 --> 20:02.791
But you…

20:04.583 --> 20:07.000
You'll do

20:07.750 --> 20:10.708
everything I tell you to, won't you?

20:14.125 --> 20:15.041
She quit?

20:15.125 --> 20:19.416
You didn't know?
She quit about a month ago.

20:19.500 --> 20:24.833
It's been a tough month.
No more long vacations for you, got it?

20:26.833 --> 20:29.541
That reminds me. You're a streamer, right?

20:29.625 --> 20:30.875
UNREAD

20:30.958 --> 20:32.250
To tell you the truth,

20:32.333 --> 20:35.375
I've been thinking about
starting streaming… Hey!

20:36.541 --> 20:38.875
You're taking off again?

20:58.208 --> 20:59.291
I won't see him

20:59.916 --> 21:01.125
ever again.

21:04.500 --> 21:05.791
But in exchange,

21:07.583 --> 21:09.500
I have one favor to ask.

21:13.125 --> 21:16.250
Please exempt
Shimura's mother's medical fees.

21:19.083 --> 21:20.041
Please.

21:38.083 --> 21:39.041
Shimura?

22:38.166 --> 22:39.958
-Yeah!
-Stop it!

22:41.666 --> 22:44.208
Stop! Give it back!

22:48.833 --> 22:49.666
Let's go, guys!

22:49.750 --> 22:51.000
-That was fun!
-Yeah.

23:00.416 --> 23:01.250
What's wrong?

23:05.083 --> 23:08.541
I'm looking for… my chick keychain.

23:10.125 --> 23:12.125
Shimura, what're you doing?

23:12.625 --> 23:13.666
I'll catch up later.

23:14.583 --> 23:16.250
I'll help you look for it.

23:46.250 --> 23:48.250
Here it is. I found it!

23:50.541 --> 23:51.625
Thank you!

23:52.125 --> 23:52.958
Kaho!

23:54.208 --> 23:55.750
What are you doing here?

23:56.250 --> 23:58.000
You're late for your recital.

23:58.083 --> 23:59.250
I'm sorry.

23:59.750 --> 24:00.583
Let's go.

24:04.083 --> 24:05.166
See you tomorrow.

24:08.375 --> 24:09.333
Excuse me.

24:10.500 --> 24:12.125
Is Shimura with you?

24:12.625 --> 24:13.458
He's not coming.

24:14.458 --> 24:16.791
His mom was hospitalized.

24:17.541 --> 24:18.375
Here.

24:18.958 --> 24:21.083
Shimura told me to give you this.

24:25.208 --> 24:27.250
Look. A cabbage butterfly.

24:27.333 --> 24:28.333
Let's go!

24:39.583 --> 24:41.416
BE STRONGER!
VIRAL_HIT

24:47.875 --> 24:49.833
We got an offer from BAD FELLOWS?

24:49.916 --> 24:51.500
Yeah! Isn't that crazy?

24:51.583 --> 24:53.416
I got a DM from their management team.

24:53.916 --> 24:56.833
Their CEO, Mr. Kuwata, wants to meet.

24:56.916 --> 24:58.250
Is it actually them?

24:58.333 --> 25:00.083
It's real! Look.

25:03.208 --> 25:04.041
Are you sure?

25:04.125 --> 25:05.000
It's real!

25:05.083 --> 25:07.541
I've met him before.

25:08.125 --> 25:09.625
What? When?

25:09.708 --> 25:11.083
Before the Shinjo fight.

25:11.166 --> 25:12.916
-Where?
-In front of my house.

25:13.000 --> 25:15.166
What? Why?

25:16.750 --> 25:19.083
He asked me if I'd want to be on his show.

25:19.958 --> 25:22.083
Why didn't you tell me?

25:22.166 --> 25:23.708
Because I wasn't interested.

25:23.791 --> 25:24.666
You idiot!

25:25.166 --> 25:26.583
This is a huge offer.

25:26.666 --> 25:29.291
If you go on BAD FELLOWS,
Viral Hit will be more famous.

25:31.458 --> 25:33.166
Maybe I should hear him out.

25:33.875 --> 25:37.000
Awesome. What's gotten into you?

25:37.083 --> 25:38.000
Nothing.

25:38.500 --> 25:40.750
I just want to make money quickly.

25:40.833 --> 25:42.166
Now you're talking.

25:42.250 --> 25:43.375
That's the spirit.

25:43.458 --> 25:45.583
I'll set up a meeting.

25:58.750 --> 26:00.458
This is so fancy.

26:00.541 --> 26:03.625
He's the one who initiated contact.
Be confident.

26:15.250 --> 26:17.708
Sorry to keep you waiting.
This way, please.

26:49.208 --> 26:50.708
I'm very honored

26:51.416 --> 26:55.791
to have you, from the popular Viral Hit,
come all this way to see me.

26:56.375 --> 26:57.250
Not at all.

26:57.333 --> 26:59.625
Thank you so much for the DM.

27:00.458 --> 27:02.833
I heard you had invited Shimura

27:02.916 --> 27:05.500
to participate in
the BAD FELLOWS tournament.

27:06.000 --> 27:06.833
Yes.

27:07.333 --> 27:12.625
We might consider it,
depending on the opponent.

27:12.708 --> 27:13.541
Right?

27:17.291 --> 27:19.291
It seems that you're confused.

27:19.958 --> 27:20.791
Huh?

27:21.791 --> 27:24.500
I did not invite you here today

27:24.583 --> 27:27.291
to offer you a fight in BAD FELLOWS.

27:29.833 --> 27:33.291
I'm interested in buying out Viral Hit.

27:34.500 --> 27:36.916
You need money, don't you?

27:38.250 --> 27:39.458
Hold on a second.

27:39.541 --> 27:41.625
There's no way we'd agree to that.

27:41.708 --> 27:44.916
Viral Hit is our channel,
and our channel only.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.791
She's right. It's not for sale.

27:46.875 --> 27:49.500
Your childish games won't work forever.

27:49.583 --> 27:50.500
Excuse me?

27:50.583 --> 27:52.125
-What's your point?
-Kanegon.

27:52.208 --> 27:57.000
Is it that you're threatened
because we're extremely popular?

27:58.958 --> 27:59.875
Threatened?

28:06.666 --> 28:08.458
Why should I be threatened

28:08.958 --> 28:11.291
by a channel
that could vanish at any time?

28:12.833 --> 28:16.291
You need to know your place.

28:18.375 --> 28:19.833
Are you kidding me?

28:20.666 --> 28:21.541
Let's go!

28:31.500 --> 28:33.458
How has your condition been?

28:34.708 --> 28:36.375
It changes from day to day,

28:36.875 --> 28:39.791
but my body often feels very heavy.

28:41.916 --> 28:45.291
I have to try to get better for my son.

28:46.291 --> 28:50.333
This cardigan was a gift from my son.

28:50.416 --> 28:53.583
I called you here to talk about your son.

28:53.666 --> 28:54.958
My son?

29:07.041 --> 29:07.958
Kota?

29:09.041 --> 29:12.500
Your son is making money by fighting.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.208
By fighting?

29:18.250 --> 29:22.708
My daughter was publicly humiliated
because of your son.

29:23.958 --> 29:28.041
There are baseless rumors on social media
that she's your son's girlfriend.

29:28.625 --> 29:30.083
Her face is exposed.

29:31.625 --> 29:33.375
This is exasperating.

29:39.083 --> 29:41.166
I will waive your medical expenses.

29:42.833 --> 29:43.666
What?

29:43.750 --> 29:46.041
In return, you must promise me

29:46.875 --> 29:50.208
that your son will never
go near my daughter again.

29:58.166 --> 30:01.666
I apologize for the trouble
my son has caused.

30:01.750 --> 30:04.041
I'm truly sorry.

30:06.500 --> 30:07.333
But…

30:09.416 --> 30:10.833
I can't promise you that.

30:12.333 --> 30:14.416
I don't have the right to decide…

30:17.041 --> 30:18.958
who my son wants to see

30:20.041 --> 30:22.500
or who he wants to talk to.

30:32.916 --> 30:34.750
What happened to your face?

30:35.458 --> 30:37.583
Don't tell me you got in a fight.

30:37.666 --> 30:40.583
What? No. I would never.

30:41.708 --> 30:44.958
Don't worry about it.
I got a special bonus at work.

30:55.791 --> 30:57.750
He seriously got on my nerves.

30:57.833 --> 31:01.416
I know, we should take down
BAD FELLOWS ourselves.

31:02.000 --> 31:06.750
That Kuwata guy seemed to know
that Shimura is in need of money.

31:06.833 --> 31:09.583
Yeah, and he knew where I lived.

31:09.666 --> 31:12.458
It's fine. They're yesterday's news.

31:12.541 --> 31:14.333
Let's find our next opponent.

31:15.125 --> 31:15.958
Huh?

31:16.833 --> 31:17.791
What is it?

31:20.208 --> 31:21.208
What the hell?

31:21.833 --> 31:22.875
What is it?

31:25.583 --> 31:27.000
Our account's been banned.

31:27.083 --> 31:27.916
SUSPENDED

31:30.625 --> 31:31.916
What's going on?

31:32.000 --> 31:33.500
I don't know either.

31:34.500 --> 31:35.958
Maybe if we log back in…

31:36.041 --> 31:37.500
What is this, Kanegon?!

31:37.583 --> 31:38.458
Look!

31:41.583 --> 31:42.625
NEW PARTNERSHIP

31:42.708 --> 31:46.291
The platform we're using
and Kuwata's company joined forces?

31:46.791 --> 31:48.458
Damn it!

31:48.541 --> 31:51.000
It had to be him! He did this to us!

31:58.791 --> 32:00.541
Why did you leave early?

32:00.625 --> 32:02.333
You abandoned a major sponsor.

32:02.833 --> 32:04.250
Sponsor?

32:04.333 --> 32:06.250
You were just pimping me out.

32:06.333 --> 32:09.083
Rumi, that's an inappropriate word.

32:10.375 --> 32:13.000
It's an important part of business.

32:13.500 --> 32:14.416
I don't get it.

32:15.458 --> 32:16.416
I've had enough.

32:17.458 --> 32:18.291
I quit.

32:18.791 --> 32:20.958
I'd rather do things on my own.

32:21.041 --> 32:22.041
I see.

32:23.583 --> 32:25.333
But you can't just leave.

32:26.208 --> 32:29.625
You haven't met your quota,
and your contract is still active.

32:30.166 --> 32:34.000
You can quit,
but can you pay the penalty, Rumi?

32:37.375 --> 32:38.583
I thought so.

32:40.083 --> 32:42.083
Fine, then…

32:43.500 --> 32:44.666
How about camgirling?

32:46.833 --> 32:50.708
You won't have to sleep with old men,
and you can use a face filter.

32:50.791 --> 32:52.375
What do you say?

32:54.458 --> 32:55.458
Sorry.

32:56.750 --> 32:58.208
I have to go.

33:00.875 --> 33:02.041
Go where?

33:03.166 --> 33:04.000
Huh?

33:05.041 --> 33:06.375
To the police?

33:24.791 --> 33:25.708
You sure?

33:26.791 --> 33:29.041
You still wanna go to the police?

33:31.000 --> 33:33.958
But that means this'll end up online.

33:55.291 --> 33:56.833
What are you doing there?

34:01.166 --> 34:03.416
Are you up to something bad again?

34:11.333 --> 34:13.291
Your agency's president?

34:15.916 --> 34:18.458
You didn't send those guys
to attack Shimura?

34:19.125 --> 34:20.166
No.

34:21.333 --> 34:24.041
We're with the same agency,
but I don't know them.

34:24.125 --> 34:26.541
When you got me drunk
and stole our password?

34:27.250 --> 34:28.833
For that I apologize.

34:29.958 --> 34:30.958
I'm sorry.

34:31.541 --> 34:32.583
Geez…

34:33.875 --> 34:36.833
But why would the president
do something like that?

34:40.041 --> 34:44.416
Our agency is part of
the BAD FELLOWS group.

34:45.250 --> 34:46.083
What?

34:48.208 --> 34:52.458
He DM'd me
so he could get close to Viral Hit.

34:53.416 --> 34:55.625
Is that true?

34:55.708 --> 34:58.083
He was looking into Viral Hit.

34:58.166 --> 35:00.875
He's wrapped around the CEO's finger.

35:05.333 --> 35:07.583
I don't know if I can trust you.

35:08.458 --> 35:11.291
You've put me through hell, after all.

35:13.125 --> 35:14.125
I'm sorry.

35:16.083 --> 35:18.166
Fine. I'll trust you.

35:19.958 --> 35:20.916
All right.

35:22.166 --> 35:23.791
Let's go to the police.

35:24.291 --> 35:26.750
We'll tell them everything.
Problem solved.

36:32.541 --> 36:34.666
Is it that bad?

36:35.333 --> 36:39.791
She's been undergoing radiation therapy,
but we're not seeing improvement.

36:40.708 --> 36:43.041
What about the immunotherapy treatment?

36:43.125 --> 36:45.708
I might be able to get the money soon.

36:45.791 --> 36:48.708
In her current condition,
it won't be effective.

36:49.583 --> 36:51.041
No…

36:54.041 --> 36:57.208
What else can we do
for my mother to get better?

36:57.291 --> 36:59.416
We could try carbon ion radiotherapy…

36:59.500 --> 37:00.458
Yes, please.

37:00.541 --> 37:02.583
It's a very expensive treatment.

37:02.666 --> 37:04.708
It's okay. I'll work for it.

37:04.791 --> 37:08.375
We'll have to monitor and adjust treatment
over multiple sessions.

37:09.625 --> 37:11.125
How much will it cost?

37:11.208 --> 37:12.708
In total,

37:13.208 --> 37:15.458
it will cost close to ten million yen.

37:16.750 --> 37:18.083
That much?

37:19.541 --> 37:22.708
But we know your family's situation.

37:22.791 --> 37:27.083
I heard the director offered
to exempt your mother's medical expenses.

37:28.666 --> 37:29.500
What?

37:48.791 --> 37:51.375
Mom, are you okay?

37:52.375 --> 37:53.208
I'm okay.

37:54.500 --> 37:56.541
Don't look so sad.

38:01.791 --> 38:03.000
I was surprised.

38:05.625 --> 38:08.041
I didn't know you had such a thing going.

38:10.333 --> 38:11.208
Huh?

38:12.791 --> 38:13.666
I'm sorry.

38:15.250 --> 38:19.541
Sorry that I said,
"Who would watch you stream?"

38:23.041 --> 38:25.083
Your channel is so popular.

38:27.041 --> 38:29.250
And you have a lot of fans.

38:30.333 --> 38:31.208
Good for you.

38:40.125 --> 38:41.041
Thanks.

38:48.125 --> 38:49.291
I…

38:51.333 --> 38:54.958
I don't want to see you getting beaten up.

38:56.833 --> 38:58.833
Even less do I want to see you

38:59.916 --> 39:01.916
beating someone up.

39:10.375 --> 39:11.625
Of course.

39:14.208 --> 39:16.000
But it's strange.

39:17.458 --> 39:18.625
Somehow,

39:19.750 --> 39:21.500
I felt happy.

39:23.750 --> 39:26.458
My son, who always seemed a bit helpless,

39:27.875 --> 39:29.791
looked so resilient.

39:34.500 --> 39:35.666
It made me realize

39:37.458 --> 39:40.916
this boy should be okay
even after I'm not around.

39:45.250 --> 39:46.958
Don't say that.

39:51.500 --> 39:52.916
It was just a thought.

40:13.916 --> 40:14.958
Hello?

40:15.041 --> 40:15.916
Shimura.

40:17.208 --> 40:19.416
It was all Kuwata's doing after all!

40:20.291 --> 40:21.958
Not just the account ban.

40:22.625 --> 40:26.333
He was targeting us from the beginning.

40:50.291 --> 40:51.125
What is it?

40:51.625 --> 40:53.083
It was you, wasn't it?

40:53.583 --> 40:55.333
You got our account banned.

40:55.833 --> 40:59.250
I told you, you need to know your place.

41:00.000 --> 41:01.958
I know about your shady side gig.

41:02.041 --> 41:03.416
So what if you do?

41:03.500 --> 41:05.916
We can upload an exposé video at anytime.

41:06.000 --> 41:07.791
Be my guest.

41:09.500 --> 41:12.166
But why don't we do this instead?

41:14.291 --> 41:16.791
I'll give you a million yen
as a fight purse.

41:16.875 --> 41:20.916
Consider this your last chance from me.

41:21.000 --> 41:22.416
Are you insane?

41:23.000 --> 41:23.875
There's no--

41:23.958 --> 41:25.291
That simplifies things.

41:28.208 --> 41:30.375
My appearance will generate buzz.

41:30.458 --> 41:32.541
Let me be on your show.

41:33.333 --> 41:34.583
I came to say that.

41:34.666 --> 41:37.250
-Shimura?
-I don't want your fight purse.

41:38.125 --> 41:41.625
Instead, I want you
to use the donation system.

41:42.416 --> 41:43.708
Donation system?

41:44.958 --> 41:47.083
We'll each take the red or blue corner,

41:47.166 --> 41:50.416
and viewers can donate
to the side they want to support.

41:51.000 --> 41:53.500
BAD FELLOWS will be streaming the match.

41:53.583 --> 41:55.541
It's not a bad deal.

41:59.625 --> 42:00.875
As for the rules,

42:01.375 --> 42:03.583
we'll use special rules from BAD FELLOWS.

42:03.666 --> 42:05.333
Three five-minute rounds.

42:06.833 --> 42:08.208
Will that do?

42:09.375 --> 42:10.291
Sure.

42:11.333 --> 42:12.625
Understood.

42:13.541 --> 42:16.833
I'll look for an opponent worthy of you.

42:18.375 --> 42:20.083
There's no need for that.

42:25.500 --> 42:27.125
My opponent is you.

42:28.000 --> 42:31.375
Don't you get cocky, twerp.

42:32.541 --> 42:35.083
A match between me
and the CEO of BAD FELLOWS.

42:35.583 --> 42:38.250
Don't you think it's the ultimate matchup?

42:39.416 --> 42:40.541
Or is it

42:41.500 --> 42:45.375
you're afraid the donation system
will expose you're less popular than me?

42:49.166 --> 42:50.083
Very well.

42:51.333 --> 42:54.041
Let's do it. You and me.

42:58.916 --> 43:00.750
The donation system, huh?

43:00.833 --> 43:04.541
We still have a million fans,
even if our account is banned.

43:04.625 --> 43:07.333
If they donate to us…

43:07.416 --> 43:09.958
Ten million isn't an impossible amount.

43:10.541 --> 43:13.375
Way to go, Shimura! You're a genius!

43:13.458 --> 43:15.500
Gross. Get off of me.

43:16.916 --> 43:20.000
We need to come up with a plan
to appeal to our fans.

43:20.083 --> 43:21.958
How about a meeting at Aki's?

43:22.041 --> 43:22.916
Sorry.

43:23.000 --> 43:24.250
I already have plans.

43:24.333 --> 43:25.166
Plans?

43:25.833 --> 43:27.000
Just some errands.

43:32.083 --> 43:33.333
I came to return this.

43:38.916 --> 43:40.166
Sorry to bother you.

43:42.000 --> 43:43.416
Your account got banned?

43:46.166 --> 43:47.000
Yes.

43:48.083 --> 43:49.250
What happened?

43:51.500 --> 43:53.208
BAD FELLOWS got to us.

43:55.625 --> 43:59.458
Shimura's going to fight their CEO next.

44:02.833 --> 44:03.750
Kuwata?

44:06.833 --> 44:08.583
Don't get mixed up with him.

44:10.958 --> 44:12.166
What do you mean?

44:20.458 --> 44:21.875
TEACH HIM A LIFE LESSON!

44:21.958 --> 44:23.833
PUNISH THE DISRESPECTFUL BRATS!

44:40.208 --> 44:41.208
Hey!

44:41.291 --> 44:42.125
Hey!

44:43.000 --> 44:44.125
You need to see this.

44:46.958 --> 44:48.416
Is this Kanegon?

44:49.333 --> 44:52.541
VIRAL HIT PRODUCER
CAUGHT UNDERAGE DRINKING

45:07.791 --> 45:09.000
SO FULL OF HIMSELF

45:11.458 --> 45:13.625
THEIR ACCOUNT DESERVES TO BE BANNED

45:14.125 --> 45:15.458
A HIGH-SCHOOL DRUNK LOL

45:16.083 --> 45:17.375
A WOMANIZING BRAT

45:17.458 --> 45:19.791
Viral Hit is facing major backlash.

45:19.875 --> 45:23.333
The Viral Hit channel
launched in February this year.

45:23.416 --> 45:26.333
This popular channel
streams a high-schooler fighting

45:26.416 --> 45:28.791
and has collected lots of donations.

45:28.875 --> 45:33.166
However, since the producer's
underage drinking video went viral,

45:33.708 --> 45:35.916
the channel has faced harsh criticism.

45:36.416 --> 45:38.583
Their fighter is Kota Shimura.

45:38.666 --> 45:39.500
BLOOD MONEY LOL

45:39.583 --> 45:41.333
The producer is Toru Kaneko.

45:41.416 --> 45:42.750
I'VE SNAPPED OUT OF IT

45:42.833 --> 45:44.500
I WANT MY MONEY BACK

45:44.583 --> 45:46.166
IT'S BASICALLY A SCAM

45:46.250 --> 45:47.833
VIRAL HIT IS FINISHED

45:48.583 --> 45:49.583
ARREST INEVITABLE

45:49.666 --> 45:52.208
Shit. Kuwata must be pulling the strings.

45:52.875 --> 45:56.166
Kuwata is a former
underground MMA champion.

45:56.666 --> 45:58.583
-Is that true?
-Shinjo told me.

45:58.666 --> 46:00.166
-Shinjo?
-There's more.

46:00.875 --> 46:04.000
He said he saw Kuwata
at the scene where his friend died.

46:10.291 --> 46:11.500
Shinjo is convinced

46:11.583 --> 46:13.208
that Kuwata is the killer.

46:14.333 --> 46:15.708
What do you mean?

46:15.791 --> 46:18.750
Shinjo got a call
on the day his friend was killed.

46:19.250 --> 46:21.666
The caller told him where his friend was.

46:22.666 --> 46:25.000
But it was a trap to frame Shinjo.

46:26.083 --> 46:28.125
Why would Kuwata kill his friend?

46:28.208 --> 46:29.208
I don't know.

46:29.291 --> 46:33.166
But this just proves
how dangerous Kuwata is.

46:33.875 --> 46:36.750
We can't expect to get
a lot of donations now.

46:36.833 --> 46:37.791
Let's back out--

46:37.875 --> 46:39.791
What else do you expect me to do?

46:40.791 --> 46:42.833
I need the money.

46:44.125 --> 46:46.791
With our account banned,
I can't make money.

46:47.333 --> 46:48.958
I have no choice but to take a chance.

46:51.041 --> 46:51.916
It's them.

46:52.000 --> 46:53.375
It's really Viral Hit!

46:53.458 --> 46:55.625
Don't film us without permission!

46:55.708 --> 46:57.208
-Busted!
-Already getting flamed!

46:57.291 --> 46:58.125
Get lost!

47:01.000 --> 47:03.833
We stand out too much together.
Let's split up.

47:03.916 --> 47:06.208
Call if anything happens. Got it?

47:16.166 --> 47:17.708
GOODBYE NORMAL LIFE LOL

47:17.791 --> 47:19.958
YOU'VE BEEN COMMITTING A CRIME

47:20.041 --> 47:22.833
WHO THINKS OF MAKING MONEY
THROUGH VIOLENCE? LOL

47:22.916 --> 47:25.083
I BET THE POLICE ARE ON TO THEM

47:25.166 --> 47:27.166
THEY WON'T GET AWAY WITH THIS

47:27.250 --> 47:30.750
TREMBLE WITH FEAR

47:31.250 --> 47:32.125
PAY US BACK

47:32.208 --> 47:33.041
I'LL KILL YOU

47:33.125 --> 47:34.000
HE'S THAT POOR?

47:34.083 --> 47:35.500
MOM'S HOSPITALIZED

47:35.583 --> 47:36.541
BAD PARENTING

47:36.625 --> 47:37.666
CLASS SHOWS

47:37.750 --> 47:38.833
YOU'RE DEAD, SHIMURA

47:38.916 --> 47:40.166
A CRIMINAL LIVES HERE

47:40.250 --> 47:41.291
PAY US BACK

47:43.291 --> 47:44.875
This must be Shimura's place.

47:46.666 --> 47:48.083
He's dirt poor.

47:53.125 --> 47:54.750
GOLD DIGGER

47:54.833 --> 47:56.333
KANEGON'S THE MASTERMIND

47:56.416 --> 47:58.291
I'LL KILL KANEGON WITHIN A WEEK

47:58.375 --> 47:59.541
I'LL HUNT YOU DOWN

48:16.125 --> 48:17.166
DIE

48:36.083 --> 48:39.625
YOUR ACCOUNT HAS BEEN SUSPENDED

48:39.708 --> 48:42.000
THIS IS VIRAL HIT'S SCHOOL

48:42.083 --> 48:43.875
DROP DEAD SHIMURA!

48:43.958 --> 48:45.875
DIE, KANEGON

48:47.125 --> 48:48.291
Nope.

48:48.375 --> 48:50.500
Kanegon won't even answer his phone.

48:50.583 --> 48:51.416
I see.

48:52.000 --> 48:53.791
I'll try calling him later.

48:54.833 --> 48:56.250
Yeah, thanks.

48:57.708 --> 48:59.916
Are you doing okay?

49:00.000 --> 49:00.833
Yeah.

49:01.500 --> 49:03.416
No matter what people say,

49:04.125 --> 49:05.541
I have to do this.

49:08.041 --> 49:09.125
Be careful.

49:09.208 --> 49:10.416
I know.

49:11.083 --> 49:11.916
You too, Aki.

49:12.958 --> 49:13.791
Yeah.

49:15.041 --> 49:16.583
Talk to you later.

49:31.083 --> 49:32.291
AKI YASHIO

49:50.791 --> 49:54.083
Kuwata is a former
underground MMA champion.

49:54.166 --> 49:56.833
You need money, don't you?

49:56.916 --> 49:58.666
In total…

49:58.750 --> 50:01.416
it will cost close to ten million yen.

50:05.750 --> 50:06.958
I'll be fine.

50:07.458 --> 50:09.375
I've got TOU-KEI on my side…

50:10.250 --> 50:11.750
NEWTUBE HOW_TO_FIGHT

50:14.625 --> 50:15.458
Huh?

50:17.000 --> 50:18.666
What is this?

50:18.750 --> 50:21.583
THIS CHANNEL HAS BEEN DELETED

50:22.916 --> 50:24.166
I'm going out.

50:24.250 --> 50:25.083
What?

50:25.583 --> 50:27.125
Where? It's late.

50:29.625 --> 50:31.083
I'm gonna get it back.

50:32.750 --> 50:33.750
Aki!

51:01.041 --> 51:02.000
Logan…

51:07.125 --> 51:09.625
TOU-KEI, where are you?

51:10.458 --> 51:12.583
I can't do this without you.

51:25.541 --> 51:27.000
Who is it?

51:28.833 --> 51:30.000
It's Asamiya.

51:31.291 --> 51:32.125
What?

51:47.541 --> 51:48.750
Hey, little shit.

51:49.375 --> 51:50.208
Hey.

52:03.708 --> 52:04.833
Please,

52:05.583 --> 52:07.708
don't take Viral Hit from us.

52:09.250 --> 52:10.375
That channel…

52:12.375 --> 52:14.833
It's a very important place for us.

52:17.375 --> 52:19.041
Because of that channel,

52:20.875 --> 52:22.666
we were saved.

52:25.291 --> 52:26.166
So, please.

52:28.875 --> 52:30.041
I'm begging you.

52:31.333 --> 52:34.541
Please give us back Viral Hit.

52:37.333 --> 52:38.375
What's wrong?

52:40.583 --> 52:43.875
I saw you getting all the hate online.

52:46.041 --> 52:46.875
Yeah.

52:46.958 --> 52:50.208
I heard you turned down the offer
to waive your mother's medical fees.

52:53.750 --> 52:55.750
I asked my dad to do it.

52:57.500 --> 52:58.791
In return I promised…

53:00.625 --> 53:02.541
I wouldn't see you anymore.

53:04.125 --> 53:04.958
What?

53:07.041 --> 53:09.458
If you didn't have to pay
the medical bills,

53:09.958 --> 53:12.250
you wouldn't have to fight anymore.

53:12.333 --> 53:14.083
You wouldn't receive backlash--

53:14.166 --> 53:15.541
I can't accept the offer.

53:16.416 --> 53:20.291
I don't want to stop seeing you.

53:21.250 --> 53:22.541
Besides…

53:24.708 --> 53:26.625
I'm not doing it just for money.

53:29.958 --> 53:32.125
I don't want it to vanish.

53:33.291 --> 53:35.458
We built that channel together.

53:42.500 --> 53:43.625
I refuse.

53:45.041 --> 53:46.291
What if I said that?

53:50.583 --> 53:52.708
If you intend to crush us,

53:54.416 --> 53:56.500
we won't go easy on you either.

54:02.750 --> 54:03.958
I see.

54:08.416 --> 54:10.250
You still don't get it, do you?

54:10.750 --> 54:15.333
Everything built on your sweat and tears…

54:15.916 --> 54:17.291
I only need a day.

54:19.708 --> 54:20.625
No.

54:20.708 --> 54:23.166
I only need a few minutes to crush it.

54:23.916 --> 54:26.125
It just shows

54:27.166 --> 54:30.166
that everything you've done so far
was nothing special.

54:32.250 --> 54:34.416
You're going to fight no matter what?

54:38.041 --> 54:39.041
But…

54:42.541 --> 54:44.791
You won't get
any more videos from TOU-KEI.

54:48.375 --> 54:50.708
How do you know about his videos?

54:51.208 --> 54:52.291
It was me.

54:53.416 --> 54:55.166
I was sending you the videos.

54:56.791 --> 54:57.750
What?

54:58.458 --> 54:59.708
Viral Hit

